Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 00:41:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 197/244] Add trading capabilities for IG instruments with
 real-time charts and order management

Implement new API endpoints and backend logic for managing a watched instrument list, including adding, removing, and retrieving instruments. Update `ceo-proxy.cjs` to include the `/api/ig/watchedlist` endpoint in authentication checks and error handling. Add a new section to `replit.md` detailing the Watched Instruments, Trading Panel, and Interactive Price Charts features, including their respective API endpoints and storage mechanisms. The provided screenshots visually represent these new functionalities.

